# ------------------------------------------------------ derived artifacts ---
# Regenerable from the source PDFs, and every one of them contains patient
# identifiers extracted verbatim from clinical documents. Reproduce with:
#   python redact.py <file>          -> *.redacted.pdf
#   python evaluate.py --report ...  -> eval-report.md
*.redacted.pdf
out.json
eval-report.md
evaluation/report*.md

# The durable record of measured results lives in evaluation/README.md, which is
# reviewed and committed deliberately rather than overwritten by every run.

