# ------------------------------------------------------------------ notes ---
# evaluation/corpus/ IS committed, by explicit decision — it holds real clinical
# documents and is the corpus every number in evaluation/README.md is measured on.
# This repository must stay private. Git history is permanent; anything committed
# here cannot be meaningfully un-committed.
